        ('MM-U01','understand','追踪外部键和单向字段投影','Trace all complete Credentials controls and explain the exact load/dump mappings. No edits.',['materials/names.md'],'explained','load produces label:A and secret:SYNTHETIC; dump produces displayName:A and ident7 with no secret. ident is not a load field and default unknown policy rejects it. data_key maps the external name, attribute the internal value; these directions are explicit projections, not automatic protection of arbitrary logs.',['external_internal_and_directional_fields_are_distinct']),
