        ('MM-C01','consult','为请求未知字段选择显式政策','Advise the declared request-field requirement using the complete unknown-policy controls, without implementation.',['materials/unknown.md'],'advice_no_code_change','Default RAISE rejects extra; EXCLUDE discards it and INCLUDE passes its raw value through. Choose explicit rejection or the declared exclusion policy; INCLUDE is not validation for undeclared values or an automatic safe request schema.',['unknown_policies_are_explicit_and_include_is_not_validation']),
        ('MM-C02','consult','明确部分更新对缺失字段的作用','Explain each complete partial-load control and advise a compatible PATCH boundary. No code or data changes.',['materials/partial.md'],'advice_no_code_change','partialTrue skips missing required fields and partial sku allows omitted sku only; present null/negative quantity still fails and partial qty does not allow missing sku. A successful partial payload is not automatically a valid complete stored object. Define application merge and complete-state validation separately.',['partial_skips_missing_fields_but_not_present_invalid_values']),
