        ('MM-D01','diagnose','先核日期输入类型再定位时间残留','A calendar-date result unexpectedly contains time. Request the field declaration, actual Python input type/value and caller reproduction before diagnosing. No edits.',[],'diagnosed_or_information_requested','Ask for field/input types first. With disclosed evidence explain datetime is a date subtype and the common temporal isinstance shortcut returns the original object. Do not assume a date-string parser bug or select a truncation policy without authorization. Missing evidence supports insufficient_information.',None),
